---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SocialBar from '../components/SocialBar.astro';

const origin = Astro.url.origin;
---
<Base
  title="About — Xenvest"
  description="Who publishes Xenvest and how to use the money and scam-awareness guides."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px">
      <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Xenvest" width="48" height="48" style="border-radius:12px" />
      <div>
        <h1 style="margin:0">About Xenvest</h1>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;opacity:.75">Practical money sense for phones in Nigeria</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="calc-card" style="margin-bottom:12px">
    <h3>What this site is</h3>
    <p class="muted">
      Xenvest publishes educational guides on side hustles, scam patterns, crypto basics, and safer payment habits.
      We are a media desk — not a bank, broker, or investment advisor. Nothing here is personalised financial advice.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-card" style="margin-bottom:12px">
    <h3>Who writes here</h3>
    <p class="muted">
      Bylines such as <strong>Xenvest Editorial</strong>, <strong>Scam Desk</strong>, or <strong>Campus Desk</strong>
      are brand team labels. They are not licensed professionals and not personal identity claims.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-card" style="margin-bottom:12px">
    <h3>How to use the site</h3>
    <ul class="muted" style="margin:0;padding-left:1.1rem;line-height:1.55">
      <li>Read a guide, then verify money moves on official apps and bank channels.</li>
      <li>Never pay “activation”, “slot”, or “upgrade” fees to strangers.</li>
      <li>Use Search for a keyword (title and summary only — light on data).</li>
      <li>Save articles on this device from Profile / Saved.</li>
      <li>If a link looks like an affiliate offer, treat it as optional — we disclose sponsored CTAs.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-card" style="margin-bottom:12px">
    <h3>Contact &amp; studio</h3>
    <p class="muted">
      Studio mark: <strong>Meziem</strong>. For corrections or tips, use the channels listed on social links below.
      This page works on any domain — links are relative to the site you opened.
    </p>
  </div>

  <SocialBar />

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      // Domain-safe: any absolute share/canonical can use current host
      try {
        window.__SITE_ORIGIN__ = window.location.origin;
      } catch (e) {}
    })();
  </script>
</Base>
